            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Russian for politics, then the Russian for a politician."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: выборы",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "выборы (výbory) — \"an election\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Выборы будут в сентябре. Výbory búdut v sentyabré. The election will be in September."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural only. Выборы президента — a presidential election."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "выборы (výbory) is built from вы- \"out\" and the root of брать \"to take\", as in выбирать \"to choose\": an election picks people out."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
