          "title": "You'll want to know: голосовать",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "голосовать (golosovát) — \"to vote\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Мы голосовали за нового мэра. My golosováli za nóvogo méra. We voted for a new mayor."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Imperfective; the present is голосую, голосуешь; the perfective is проголосовать. Голосовать за + accusative, против + genitive."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "голосовать (golosovát) is built on голос \"voice\", inherited through Old East Slavic golosŭ from Proto-Slavic golsŭ \"voice\" (EtymDB). The -оло- is the native Russian shape: to vote is to give your voice."
            }
          ]
        },
